#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:3
#: 81ed581f872f4175ba96ad8938a3a5b1
msgid "条件替换（Conditional Replace）"
msgstr "Conditional Replace"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:5
#: 193aad67a69c489f88dec475793c60f4
msgid "**分类：** 合金与组分"
msgstr "**Category:** Alloys and composition"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:7
#: 504001ca7e1048ed838eb3d634908b49
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:9
#: 3af352f57c534c2f9cd0d66c3e6e9797
msgid ""
"按空间坐标条件对指定元素做区域选择性替换。用笛卡尔 `x/y/z` 坐标表达式（如 "
"`z>=8 and z<=10`）筛选候选位点；所有命中位点都会被替换，未命中区域保持原样。"
"多个替换元素后面的比例只决定它们如何分配到命中位点，不表示“替换多少位点”。适"
"合表面钝化、界面修饰、层状材料选择性改性等场景。"
msgstr "Perform region-selective replacement of specified elements using spatial conditions. Cartesian `x/y/z` expressions such as `z>=8 and z<=10` select candidate sites; every matching site is replaced while nonmatching regions remain unchanged. Ratios after multiple replacement elements determine only how replacements are assigned to matching sites, not how many sites are replaced. Use it for surface passivation, interface modification, and selective changes in layered materials."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:11
#: 2e53d49a1ac14ce6a090ca82bdf3551a
msgid ""
"与 `Random Doping` 的区别：`Conditional Replace` 用坐标表达式精确划定空间区"
"域，输出一个结构并替换全部命中位点；`Random Doping` 按数量或浓度做部分替位，"
"可以生成多个结构，也可以读取 `Group Label` 写入的 group 标签。"
msgstr "Difference from `Random Doping`: `Conditional Replace` defines a spatial region precisely with an expression, produces one structure, and replaces every matching site. `Random Doping` performs partial substitution by count or concentration, can generate multiple structures, and can read group labels written by `Group Label`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:13
#: d56c9465f9d647fc90701bf44804bf7c
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principle and formulas"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:15
#: d1497c9e04d84fb8a4d0b137cafce1ec
msgid "程序先用元素和 Cartesian 坐标条件形成候选集合"
msgstr "The program first builds a candidate set from the element and Cartesian-coordinate condition"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:17
#: d151509a345341939124ad7f513d1853
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal I=\\{i: Z_i=Z_{\\mathrm{target}}\\}\\cap\n"
"\\bigcap_k\\{i:x_{ik}\\ \\mathrm{op}_k\\ c_k\\}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:22
#: faa413c7c3234429a552f03e82db108f
msgid ""
"其中 $k\\in\\{x,y,z\\}$，比较符可以是大于、小于或等于；等于判断使用固定 "
"$10^{-4}$ Å 容差。替换权重会归一化为概率 $p_e$。`精确`模式对 $|\\mathcal I|$ "
"个位点使用最大余数法确定每种替换元素的整数计数；`随机`模式让每个位点 独立按类"
"别分布 $P(Z_i=e)=p_e$ 抽样。前者控制单个结构的计数，后者允许结构间产生组分涨"
"落。"
msgstr "Here $k\\in\\{x,y,z\\}$, and comparisons may use greater-than, less-than, or equality; equality uses a fixed $10^{-4}$ Å tolerance. Replacement weights are normalized to probabilities $p_e$. `Exact` mode uses the largest-remainder method to determine integer counts for $|\\mathcal I|$ sites; `Random` mode samples each site independently from $P(Z_i=e)=p_e$. The former controls counts within one structure, while the latter allows composition fluctuations between structures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:27
#: bf9309e9d54c4c6a9c8a99927a0600e7
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:29
#: c040bb13054b43f5b48f911780489006
msgid "场景：模型在表面化学上完全失效，但体相预测很好"
msgstr "Scenario: Good bulk predictions but failed surface chemistry"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:31
#: 3f2047a309114923943e7991c417d488
msgid ""
"你在 MgO 表面上训练了一个 NEP 模型，训练数据覆盖了完美晶体和表面弛豫结构。体"
"相弹性常数和声子谱都很好，但一跑有表面吸附或表面钝化的结构，模型就崩了——能量"
"误差是体相的 10 倍。诊断结果是：训练集里所有 O 原子都处于体相八面体配位环境，"
"模型从未见过低配位表面 O 的局域环境，更不知道表面 O 被 F 替换后会发生什么。"
msgstr ""
"An MgO NEP covers perfect crystals and relaxed clean surfaces and reproduces "
"bulk elasticity and phonons, but its error rises tenfold for adsorbed or "
"passivated surfaces. All training O atoms occupy bulk-like octahedral "
"environments; low-coordination surface O and F-substituted surface sites are "
"missing."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:33
#: 7f924177161e4d2484d3e844d7b33594
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 表面原子的化学环境与体相完全不同——配位数低、悬挂键多、更活泼。"
"如果训练集缺少表面区域的元素变化（如 F 钝化表面 O），模型会对表面化学完全盲"
"猜。解决办法是用条件替换把表面几层的特定元素换成钝化元素，让模型学习表面化学"
"环境。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Surface chemistry differs from the bulk through lower "
"coordination and dangling bonds. Create region-specific substitutions, such "
"as replacing O with F in the outer layers, so subsequent DFT labels teach "
"the model those environments."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:35
#: ae85d2977c4a47009b87f20d3786b6cb
msgid "**输入：** 一个 MgO 表面 slab 结构，z 方向 0-16 Å，表面 O 位于高 z 区域"
msgstr "**Input:** An MgO slab spanning z = 0-16 Å with surface O at high z."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:37
#: 43e58160fbcc4cf98d8c4749d17c959e
msgid "**目标：** 把顶层 2 Å 区域内的 O 替换为 F，模拟表面氟化"
msgstr ""
"**Objective:** Replace O with F in the top 2 Å to model surface fluorination."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:39
#: 6f939f783adc4c819dd62b928055ad99
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:40
#: 68db0d5c4bbe42e198261590c2b6a731
msgid "`目标元素`（`target`） = `O`"
msgstr "`Target element` (`target`) = `O`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:41
#: e66de0b4e8fb424faa9042cd5e120ca4
msgid "`替换元素及相对比例`（`replacements`） = `F:1.0`"
msgstr "`Replacement elements and relative ratios` (`replacements`) = `F:1.0`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:42
#: cad5c668b19843488c8e00a6677e76f0
msgid "`位置筛选`（`condition`） = `z>=14 and z<=16`"
msgstr "`Position filter` (`condition`) = `z>=14 and z<=16`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:43
#: b08bf418fb7b4859a771c51449686d95
msgid ""
"`元素分配方式`（`mode`） = `1`（只有一种替换元素时，两个分配模式的结果相同）"
msgstr "`Element allocation mode` (`mode`) = `1` (the modes are equivalent when only one replacement element is used)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:45
#: 4f97f87a281c450b85d70343aee63b1a
msgid ""
"**输出：** 1 个结构，满足 z 在 14-16 Å 的所有 O 被替换为 F，其余区域不变。带 "
"`Repl(O->F)` 标签"
msgstr "**Output:** one structure in which every O with z between 14 and 16 Å is replaced by F; all other regions are unchanged. The structure carries the `Repl(O->F)` label."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:47
#: 9a13937713b649e99c2ef853f36501b0
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:48
#: 5e32c17ddb4a43e3a8e368e24aea795c
msgid ""
"重训后跑表面吸附测试，力的 MAE 应该显著降低，不再在表面区域出现异常大力误差"
msgstr ""
"After labeling and retraining, surface-adsorption force MAE should decrease "
"and extreme errors should no longer concentrate at the surface."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:49
#: 7ace5fb0be274ba680bdf0f700027669
msgid ""
"抽查输出，确认只有表面区域被替换，体相原子保持不变——如果体相也被动了，"
"condition 表达式有问题"
msgstr ""
"Inspect output coordinates and confirm that only the surface region changed. "
"Bulk substitutions indicate an incorrect condition."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:50
#: 2f1dcf00841c42ac8d2313e4a98323ad
msgid ""
"如果需要多元素钝化，把 `替换元素及相对比例`（`replacements`）写成 "
"`F:0.5,Cl:0.5`"
msgstr "For multi-element passivation, set `Replacement elements and relative ratios` (`replacements`) to `F:0.5,Cl:0.5`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:51
#: 0483b8f0471d4a228db526bab19ee014
msgid "如果表面层厚度不确定，先用 `all` 条件验证替换配方正确性，再收紧 z 范围"
msgstr ""
"If the surface interval is uncertain, validate the replacement recipe with "
"`all`, then narrow the z condition after inspecting coordinates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:53
#: 5a9a15617c6440b099bf4defea5bd891
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:55
#: b29008abf5da486abdf550ca571e2424
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:56
#: 594785825c034e7485a55ec8ead7fa3a
msgid "模型对表面/界面/晶界区域的预测质量显著差于体相"
msgstr ""
"Surface, interface, or grain-boundary predictions are much worse than bulk "
"predictions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:57
#: c1e312688ed749dda6947eb9a4c0479f
msgid "需要做区域选择性化学改性：表面钝化、界面掺杂、层状材料夹层替换"
msgstr ""
"Region-selective chemistry is needed for passivation, interface doping, or "
"layer replacement"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:58
#: 0e45e5664aa2400aa66ee363db909225
msgid "替换规则可以用 x/y/z 坐标表达式写清楚"
msgstr "The target region can be expressed with x, y, and z coordinates"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:60
#: 34adc16066914ab6ae6a178aec8ee72e
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:61
#: 5a97474dac25468c8309b8f04a644d29
msgid "不需要空间选择性 → 用 `Random Doping` 更直接"
msgstr "No spatial selection is needed; use `Random Doping`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:62
#: a6dfe720d2824256a3334c852cf3ca88
msgid "替换规则无法用 x/y/z 表达式描述（如按近邻配位筛选）"
msgstr "The rule depends on topology or coordination rather than coordinates"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:63
#: 5c12a6257b9f4b259d0745ccaf2fdd86
msgid ""
"只需要全局组合配比变化 → `Composition Space Sampling` + `Random Occupancy`"
msgstr "For global composition changes only → `Composition Space Sampling` + `Random Occupancy`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:65
#: 0c6f96cea09d4b6c88f96e16c35312da
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:67
#: 7045c2bb4b364b9993d26dba01bfdac0
msgid "目标元素（target）"
msgstr "target"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:69
#: a39ff27033e34c3db102933c9a197e9f
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。被替换的元素符号，如 `O`、`Si`。只替换匹配该元素且满足下面 `位"
"置筛选`（`condition`）的那部分位点。"
msgstr "`str`, default empty. The symbol of the element to replace, such as `O` or `Si`. Only sites matching this element and the `Position filter` (`condition`) below are replaced."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:71
#: 7a57191174114f478dd5b06e5ba610a7
msgid "替换元素及相对比例（replacements）"
msgstr "replacements"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:73
#: 80f796ecb3614361b4ee2d8dc2b9b9df
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。替换配方，支持逗号冒号 `F:0.7,N:0.3` 或 JSON dict "
"`{\"F\":0.7,\"N\":0.3}` 两种写法。比例会被自动归一化，只用于在命中位点之间分"
"配 F 和 N；它不是替换率，所有命中位点仍然都会被替换。只填 `F` 等价于 "
"`F:1.0`。"
msgstr "`str`, default empty. Replacement recipe, accepted as `F:0.7,N:0.3` or JSON dict `{\"F\":0.7,\"N\":0.3}`. Ratios are normalized automatically and only distribute F and N among matching sites; they are not a replacement rate, and every matching site is still replaced. Entering only `F` is equivalent to `F:1.0`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:75
#: 7b3c0e48c5824e0e87d943b6c2d3cae8
msgid "位置筛选（condition）"
msgstr "condition"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:77
#: d3082e4b30eb4791935df295b8fb173d
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `all`。空间条件表达式，`all` 表示所有目标元素都命中。支持变量 "
"`x`/`y`/`z`（笛卡尔坐标，单位 Å），比较运算符 `<`/`>`/`<=`/`>=`/`==`/`!=`，逻"
"辑 `and`/`or`/`not`，以及四则运算。相等判断可写 `x=0` 或 `x==0`，两者含义相"
"同；内部使用 `1e-4 Å` 容差。"
msgstr "`str`, default `all`. Spatial condition expression; `all` selects all target elements. Supported variables are `x`/`y`/`z` (Cartesian coordinates in Å), comparison operators `<`/`>`/`<=`/`>=`/`==`/`!=`, logical operators `and`/`or`/`not`, and arithmetic. Equality may be written as `x=0` or `x==0`; both have the same meaning and use a `1e-4 Å` tolerance internally."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:79
#: 7dee72c30e60417b96a597e0d19c73dd
msgid "典型例子："
msgstr "Examples:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:80
#: 8b68451a68074dc7a5d87404e74cb9f3
msgid "`z>=8 and z<=10`：替换 z 在 8-10 Å 范围内的 target 原子"
msgstr "`z>=8 and z<=10`: select target atoms between 8 and 10 Å along z"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:81
#: ab1da0302d33404b8c9f28d5fd7db872
msgid "`x>5 or y<2`：替换特定 xy 象限内的原子"
msgstr "`x>5 or y<2`: select atoms in the specified xy regions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:82
#: 3f18271446df4ac7aad097ff33dc9ab9
msgid "`z<=4`：只替换底层"
msgstr "`z<=4`: select only the bottom layer"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:84
#: ce21d686189f4aa4af87efb650651eab
msgid "元素分配方式（mode）"
msgstr "mode"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:86
#: 4906a6f301274ec6983f4d749e6c01a8
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 0。两个模式都会替换所有命中位点，区别只在多个替换元素的数量分配："
msgstr "`int`, default 0. Both modes replace every matching site; they differ only in how counts are allocated among multiple replacement elements:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:88
#: b1ff27a5811143d095ebbcf42e43de12
msgid ""
"`0` = `逐位随机分配`：每个位点独立按相对比例抽取替换元素，最终计数可能偏离目"
"标比例。"
msgstr "`0` = `Per-site random allocation`: sample a replacement element independently at each site according to the relative ratios; final counts may differ from the target ratios."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:89
#: 6911efa5ae444613889dcd757d594422
msgid ""
"`1` = `尽量匹配整体比例`：先把比例换算成整数计数，再随机分配到命中位点，最终"
"计数尽量接近目标比例。"
msgstr "`1` = `Match overall ratios`: convert ratios to integer counts first, then distribute them randomly among matching sites so the final counts are as close as possible to the target ratios."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:91
#: 7847ffa9220447a3af2456a05282ddf5
msgid "只有一个替换元素时，两个模式的结果相同。"
msgstr "The two modes are equivalent when there is only one replacement element."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:93
#: 88820c0cd0fb4925a416a78f0bb31f3d
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:95
#: 22804b235b9c46f5ac50f4d0e2618208
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 0。界面取消勾选“使用固定种子”时保存为 `0`，表示每次运行随机；勾选"
"后保存输入的正整数，使位点分配可复现。"
msgstr "`int`, default 0. When `Use fixed seed` is disabled, the interface saves `0` and each run is random; when enabled, it saves the entered positive integer so site allocation is reproducible."

