msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:146
#: 24c7e7163be244dc9f7221cd40a34ff5
msgid ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder` → `Conditional Replace`：先生成表面或界面模板，再"
"按坐标区域做元素替换。"
msgstr "`Crystal Prototype Builder` → `Conditional Replace`: generate a surface or interface template first, then replace elements by coordinate region."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:147
#: 7064abc9d4d94aad981dcd36d7f1eccf
msgid ""
"`Conditional Replace` → `Atomic Perturb`：替换后加坐标噪声，松弛替换引入的局"
"部应力。"
msgstr "`Conditional Replace` → `Atomic Perturb`: add coordinate noise after replacement to relax local stress introduced by the substitution."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:148
#: 15bc2789c7914a14a90adfa7ee33bfa2
msgid ""
"`Conditional Replace` → `Random Doping`：先做区域选择性替换覆盖表面化学，再做"
"全局替位补样。"
msgstr ""
"`Conditional Replace` -> `Random Doping`: cover region-specific surface "
"chemistry before global substitution diversity."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:150
#: a41da77bfeae47f8bb42a12728f6b923
msgid ""
"如果需要按 group 标签选择位点，应使用 `Group Label` → `Random Doping`；本卡不"
"读取 group 标签。"
msgstr "To select sites by group labels, use `Group Label` → `Random Doping`; this card does not read group labels."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:152
#: 8ac9429619544c439f9039876b64f0e9
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:154
#: 834c978ca68443eb8c8f767b75fef14d
msgid ""
"**输出 = 输入，没有替换。** `目标元素`（`target`）为空，或输入结构中不存在该"
"元素，或 `位置筛选`（`condition`）把所有候选位点都过滤掉了。先用 "
"`condition=all` 验证替换逻辑，再逐步收紧条件。"
msgstr "**Output = input, with no replacement.** `Target element` (`target`) is empty, the input contains no such element, or `Position filter` (`condition`) removed every candidate site. First verify the replacement logic with `condition=all`, then tighten the condition gradually."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:156
#: e57b8d352f754892b19ac8cefadef15c
msgid ""
"**替换了不该替换的位点。** condition 表达式区域范围写错了。检查结构坐标范围，"
"确认上下限对应目标区域。Slab 的真空层可能导致 z 坐标超出预期。"
msgstr ""
"**Unexpected sites were replaced.** Inspect the structure's coordinate range "
"and correct the condition bounds. Vacuum in a slab can make z limits "
"unintuitive."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:158
#: 0d662ed4f6314a1a93b91bf1665dce24
msgid ""
"**condition 解析失败。** 检查变量是否只用了 x/y/z，并确认没有 `===`、函数调用"
"等不支持的语法。`=`、`==`、`>=`、`<=`、`!=` 都是合法写法；非法表达式会明确抛"
"出 `ValueError`。"
msgstr ""
"**The condition could not be parsed.** Check that it uses only x/y/z "
"variables and does not contain unsupported syntax such as `===` or function "
"calls. `=`, `==`, `>=`, `<=`, and `!=` are all valid. An invalid expression "
"raises `ValueError` explicitly."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:160
#: dd323771f3284499bb8f9e28bd2364e4
msgid ""
"**随机模式为什么没有保留一部分原元素？** 这里的“随机”只表示在多个替换元素之间"
"逐位随机分配，不表示随机决定是否替换。要控制替换数量或浓度，请使用 `Random "
"Doping`。"
msgstr "**Why does random mode not retain some original elements?** Here, `random` means only that replacement elements are assigned randomly site by site; it does not randomly decide whether to replace a site. To control the replacement count or concentration, use `Random Doping`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:162
#: 52eec085e31246d0a801b24e1931d970
msgid ""
"**替换后键长不合理。** 纯化学替换不做结构弛豫。如果键长明显异常，建议后接弛豫"
"计算。"
msgstr ""
"**Bond lengths are unreasonable after replacement.** This operation changes "
"species without relaxation. Relax the structure before treating it as a "
"physical configuration."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:164
#: 4bc42b34abef4b91a3e97013794a8173
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:166
#: bacb773ecb4d412d88d02040e7bbff17
msgid "`Repl(O->F)` / `Repl(O->F,N,Cl)` 格式。仅在确实发生了替换时才写入标签。"
msgstr ""
"Formats: `Repl(O->F)` and `Repl(O->F,N,Cl)`. A label is added only when a "
"replacement occurs."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:168
#: dfd68fbeeb844280963316c971098ac9
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:170
#: c8a7456dff6240ad9a612a954fa49985
msgid ""
"固定非零 `随机种子`（`seed`） → 相同输入可复现。多元素替换模式下 seed 控制哪"
"个位点分配到哪个替换元素。`seed=0` 表示每次运行随机。"
msgstr "A fixed nonzero `Random seed` (`seed`) makes the same input reproducible. In multielement replacement mode, the seed controls which replacement element is assigned to each site. `seed=0` makes every run random."

#~ msgid "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `ConditionalReplaceCard`"
#~ msgstr "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `ConditionalReplaceCard`"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "按空间坐标条件对指定元素做区域选择性替换。用 x/y/z 坐标表达式（如 `z>=8 "
#~ "and z<=10`）筛选候选位点，只替换命中区域内的原子，未命中区域保持原样。适合"
#~ "表面钝化、界面修饰、层状材料选择性改性等场景。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Replace a selected element only where a spatial-coordinate condition is "
#~ "true. Expressions such as `z>=8 and z<=10` select candidate sites; atoms "
#~ "outside the region remain unchanged. Use this for surface passivation, "
#~ "interface modification, or layer-selective chemistry."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "与 `Random Doping` 的区别：`Random Doping` 对全体 target 原子做无差别随机"
#~ "替换；`Conditional Replace` 先用坐标条件筛选位点，再在命中区域内做替换。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Unlike `Random Doping`, which samples all target atoms globally, "
#~ "`Conditional Replace` first restricts sites with a coordinate expression "
#~ "and replaces only within that region."

#~ msgid "`target` = `O`"
#~ msgstr "`target` = `O`"

#~ msgid "`replacements` = `F:1.0`"
#~ msgstr "`replacements` = `F:1.0`"

#~ msgid "`condition` = `z>=8 and z<=10`"
#~ msgstr "`condition` = `z>=8 and z<=10`"

#~ msgid "`mode` = `1` （Exact 模式，确保全部命中位点被替换）"
#~ msgstr "`mode` = `1` (Exact mode)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出：** 1 个结构，满足 z 在 8-10 Å 的所有 O 被替换为 F，其余区域不变。"
#~ "带 `Repl(O->F)` 标签"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** One structure in which all matching O at z = 8-10 Å become F, "
#~ "with all other regions unchanged and label `Repl(O->F)`."

#~ msgid "如果需要多元素钝化，把 `replacements` 写成 `F:0.5,Cl:0.5`"
#~ msgstr "For mixed passivation, use a recipe such as `F:0.5,Cl:0.5`."

#~ msgid "只需要全局组合配比变化 → `Composition Sweep` + `Random Occupancy`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Only global composition should change; use `Composition Sweep` with "
#~ "`Random Occupancy`"

#~ msgid "Target（target）"
#~ msgstr "Target（target）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认空。被替换的元素符号，如 `O`、`Si`。只替换匹配该元素且满足下面 "
#~ "`condition` 的那部分位点。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, empty by default. Element to replace, such as `O` or `Si`. A site "
#~ "must match both this element and `condition`."

#~ msgid "Replacements（replacements）"
#~ msgstr "Replacements（replacements）"

#, python-brace-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认空。替换配方，支持逗号冒号 `F:0.7,N:0.3` 或 JSON dict "
#~ "`{\"F\":0.7,\"N\":0.3}` 两种写法。比例会被自动归一化，在命中区域内按比例随"
#~ "机分配替换元素。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, empty by default. Replacement recipe in comma-colon form such as "
#~ "`F:0.7,N:0.3` or as JSON ` {\"F\":0.7,\"N\":0.3}`. Fractions are "
#~ "normalized and replacement species are assigned within the selected "
#~ "region."

#~ msgid "Condition（condition）"
#~ msgstr "Condition（condition）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认空。空间条件表达式，不填或填 `all` = 所有 target 原子都命中。支"
#~ "持变量 `x`/`y`/`z`（笛卡尔坐标，单位 Å），比较运算符 `<`/`>`/`<=`/`>=`/"
#~ "`==`/`!=`，逻辑 `and`/`or`/`not`，以及四则运算。相等判断可写 `x=0` 或 "
#~ "`x==0`，两者含义相同。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, empty by default. A spatial condition expression. Leave it empty "
#~ "or use `all` to match every target atom. Supported variables are `x`/`y`/"
#~ "`z` (Cartesian coordinates in Å), comparison operators `<`/`>`/`<=`/`>=`/"
#~ "`==`/`!=`, logical operators `and`/`or`/`not`, and arithmetic operators. "
#~ "Equality may be written as `x=0` or `x==0`; the two forms are equivalent."

#~ msgid "Mode（mode）"
#~ msgstr "Mode（mode）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 0。`0` = Random 模式（按比例概率随机采样），`1` = Exact 模式"
#~ "（尽量精确匹配比例计数）。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `0`. `0` is Random mode, which samples according to "
#~ "probabilities; `1` is Exact mode, which matches integer species counts as "
#~ "closely as possible."

#~ msgid "Seed（seed）"
#~ msgstr "Seed（seed）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 0。非 0 时固定随机路径，控制多元素替换的分配随机性。`0` 表示每"
#~ "次运行随机。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `0`. A nonzero seed fixes the site-to-species assignment "
#~ "for mixed replacements; zero requests a new random assignment on each run."

